  "prefLabel": "Plc 1601.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1601.02 Applicability.\n\n(a) As stated in RSA 326-M:2, I, “beginning January 1, 2024, a nurse agency seeking to do business in the state shall submit an application to the office of professional licensure and certification.”\n\n(b) This chapter shall apply to any nurse agency seeking to do business in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
